---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section class="sec" id="what-we-track" aria-labelledby="track-title">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="tag">What we track</span>
    <h2 id="track-title">Three papers. Three colours.</h2>
    <p>
      Every paper has its own colour, on this page and in the app, so you can tell them apart at a
      glance.
    </p>
  </div>
  <ul class="track">
    <li class="tcard d-licence">
      <span class="ti"><Icon name="licence" /></span>
      <span class="cad">Renewed every year</span>
      <h3>Vehicle licence</h3>
      <p>Upload it once. Its details set up your car, and we track the expiry date from there.</p>
      <div class="eg"><span>Valid until 14 Mar 2027</span><b>154 days</b></div>
    </li>
    <li class="tcard d-insurance">
      <span class="ti"><Icon name="shield" /></span>
      <span class="cad">Third party or comprehensive</span>
      <h3>Insurance</h3>
      <p>
        Tell us your cover type and expiry date. We remind you in good time and handle the renewal.
      </p>
      <div class="eg"><span>Expires 20 Oct 2026</span><b class="t-warn">9 days</b></div>
    </li>
    <li class="tcard d-road">
      <span class="ti"><Icon name="gauge" /></span>
      <span class="cad">Renewed every year</span>
      <h3>Roadworthiness</h3>
      <p>
        Add your certificate's expiry date and we'll make sure it never lapses without you knowing.
      </p>
      <div class="eg"><span>Valid until 2 Feb 2027</span><b>114 days</b></div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
